                  "text": "Zakariya 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo, nabii Hagai na nabii Zakariya wa kula chivyazi cha Ido atabiri kuhusu Ayahudi a Juda na Jerusalemu kpwa dzina ra Mlungu wa Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
